          "script": "\n#\tsystem.perspective.print(\u0027assetOPDashboardSelected() msg rcvd with %s\u0027%payload)\n\tdashboardInfo \u003d payload[\u0027selection\u0027][0][\u0027value\u0027] if len(payload[\u0027selection\u0027]) \u003e 0 else None\n\t\n\tdisplay \u003d self.view.custom.display\n\tdashboardFilter \u003d dict(display[\u0027dashboardFilter\u0027])\n\tdashboardFilter[\u0027dashboardId\u0027] \u003d dashboardInfo[\u0027dashboardId\u0027] or -1 if dashboardInfo else -1\n\tdashboardFilter[\u0027edited\u0027] \u003d False\n\t\n#\tsystem.perspective.print(\u0027checking if this is default dashboard\u0027)\n\tif dashboardInfo and dashboardInfo[\u0027dashboardId\u0027] is not None:\n\t\tdashboardFilter[\u0027edited\u0027] \u003d True\n#\t\tscreenDashboards \u003d system.kanoa.utilities.convertDatasetToJSON(system.kanoa.dashboard.getScreenDashboards({\u0027assetId\u0027: display[\u0027dashboardFilter\u0027][\u0027assetId\u0027], \u0027screenName\u0027: display[\u0027screenName\u0027]}))\n\t\tfor item in self.view.custom.screenDashboards:\n\t\t\tif item[\u0027assetId\u0027] and item[\u0027dashboardId\u0027] \u003d\u003d dashboardInfo[\u0027dashboardId\u0027]:\n\t\t\t\tdashboardFilter[\u0027edited\u0027] \u003d False\n\t\t\t\tbreak\n\t\t\n\tself.view.custom.display.dashboardFilter \u003d dashboardFilter\n\n\treturn",
